            "sid": "ZEC 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ambĩa, Wĩona kyaũ? Nakwa nasya, Nĩnoona, na, sisya, kĩndũ kĩla kĩkĩawa mataa kya thaavu mũthei, kĩ na mbakũli yakyo ĩũlũ wakyo, na mataa makyo mũonza ĩũlũ wakyo; ve mĩtote mũonza ĩvikĩte kĩla taanĩ ũla wĩ ĩũlũ wakyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
